{"branch":"시흥대야점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">시흥대야점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-354c2abc27f4734e.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"시흥대야점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-354c2abc27f4734e.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>경기 시흥시 은행로167번길 7 크리스탈빌딩 503, 504호</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 지하철</h3><ul class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-line\">서해선</span><span>시흥대야역</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>성원아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>은계초등학교.사랑스러운교회</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>신명아파트.대우3차아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>은계중</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>늘푸른벽산.서강2차</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">6</span><span>은계중</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><dl class=\"kd-buses\"><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">간선</span></dt><dd><span>22</span><span>5</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">일반</span></dt><dd><span>1</span><span>12</span><span>26</span><span>27</span><span>31</span><span>31-3</span><span>36</span><span>63</span><span>500</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">마을</span></dt><dd><span>015</span><span>1-B</span><span>N1-B(심야)</span><span>1-A</span><span>N1-A(심야)</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">직행</span></dt><dd><span>3200</span><span>3201</span></dd></div></dl></d